().get(0), \"topic\")) {\n                final String template = command.getArgs().subList(1, command.getArgs().size()).stream().collect(Collectors.joining(\" \"));\n\n                final StrSubstitutor substitutor = new StrSubstitutor(variables.getVariables());\n                final String replaced = substitutor.replace(template);\n                context.getRoomApi().setTopic(replaced);\n\n                return SUCCESS;\n            }\n        }\n        return FAILURE;\n    }", "signature": "PluginMessageHandlingResult onCommand(Command command)", "full_signature": "public PluginMessageHandlingResult onCommand(Command command)", "class_method_signature": "TemplatePlugin.onCommand(Command command)", "testcase": false, "constructor": false, "invocations": ["equalsIgnoreCase", "getCommand", "equals", "get", "getArgs", "collect", "stream", "subList", "getArgs", "size", "getArgs", "joining", "getVariables", "replace", "setTopic", "getRoomApi"]}, "repository": {"repo_id": 63898559, "url": "https://github.com/RoyJacobs/lazybot", "language": "Java", "is_fork": false, "fork_count": 0, "stargazer_count": 5, "size": 185, "license": "licensed"}}